,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"43:58","t":"And they said, \"Are our gods better, or is he?\" They did not present it [i.e., the comparison] except for [mere] argument. But, [in fact], they are a people prone to dispute.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"43:59","t":"He [i.e., Jesus] was not but a servant upon whom We bestowed favor, and We made him an example for the Children of Israel.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"43:60","t":"And if We willed, We could have made [instead] of you angels succeeding [one another] on the earth.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":60,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[43],"sajdah":false}